cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PlanetPostStats.jl"
abstract: "Julia package with modules for statistical post-processing of output from program scaleacc applied to raw data from simulations with ModelE or its generalization for exoplanets, ROCKE-3D. The modules extract selected individual variables, derive more variables, generate time series, calculate means and standard deviations, and write to new files."
